♪ (crowd) Class Diagram! Attributes, plus and minus! ♪

173
00:15:54.080 --> 00:15:58.620
♪ New provider, same interface: does the app change? ♪

174
00:15:58.620 --> 00:16:02.867
♪ (crowd) No! It only knows the interface! ♪

175
00:16:03.167 --> 00:16:12.813
(narrator) The outro: gold type, draw it out, while it's cheap to change, framed by the four diagrams from the chorus, the Class, Sequence, State Machine, and Component Diagrams.

176
00:16:12.813 --> 00:16:22.575
(narrator) In the middle, the architect holds up the rolled drawing, looks round the four diagrams, and, as the hook is sung a second time, sketches along, bows, and waves goodbye.

177
00:16:23.173 --> 00:16:27.073
♪ Draw it out while it's cheap to change! ♪

178
00:16:27.073 --> 00:16:30.873
[music]

179
